#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: beltoft-gift-cards-pro.php
msgid "Beltoft Gift Cards for WooCommerce - Pro"
msgstr "Beltoft Gift Cards for WooCommerce - Pro"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: beltoft-gift-cards-pro.php
msgid "https://beltoft.net/beltoft-gift-cards-pro"
msgstr "https://beltoft.net/beltoft-gift-cards-pro"

#. Description of the plugin
#: beltoft-gift-cards-pro.php
msgid ""
"Premium add-on for Beltoft Gift Cards for WooCommerce — scheduled delivery, "
"PDF gift cards, store credit, bulk generation, BOGO promotions, and "
"analytics. Requires the free core plugin."
msgstr ""
"Extensão premium para o Smart Gift Cards for WooCommerce — entrega agendada, "
"temas de e-mail, crédito de loja, geração em massa, promoções BOGO e "
"análises. Requer o plugin gratuito."

#. Author of the plugin
#: beltoft-gift-cards-pro.php
msgid "beltoft.net"
msgstr "beltoft.net"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: beltoft-gift-cards-pro.php
msgid "https://beltoft.net"
msgstr "https://beltoft.net"

#: beltoft-gift-cards-pro.php:50 beltoft-gift-cards-pro.php:90
msgid ""
"Beltoft Gift Cards for WooCommerce - Pro requires the free \"Beltoft Gift "
"Cards for WooCommerce\" plugin to be installed and activated."
msgstr ""
"O Smart Gift Cards for WooCommerce - Pro requer que o plugin gratuito "
"\"Smart Gift Cards for WooCommerce\" esteja instalado e ativo."

#: beltoft-gift-cards-pro.php:80
msgid ""
"Beltoft Gift Cards for WooCommerce - Pro requires WooCommerce to be "
"installed and activated."
msgstr ""
"O Smart Gift Cards for WooCommerce - Pro requer que o WooCommerce esteja "
"instalado e ativo."

#: beltoft-gift-cards-pro.php:100
msgid ""
"Beltoft Gift Cards for WooCommerce - Pro requires version 1.6.0 or higher of "
"the free plugin. Please update."
msgstr ""
"Beltoft Gift Cards for WooCommerce - Pro requer a versão 1.5.0 ou superior "
"do plugin gratuito. Por favor atualize."

